  "supportBody": "VitoMy is built by one person, with no ads and no account, and your stack is never sent anywhere. A tip is a way to say the app is worth keeping. It unlocks nothing, and nothing changes afterwards.",
  "@supportBody": {
    "description": "The one paragraph on the support screen. Three claims, each literally true and each checked elsewhere: no advertising SDK ships (test/purchases/network_dependency_test.dart), there is no account of any kind, and supplement data never reaches the network (test/purchases/purchase_privacy_test.dart). The last sentence is not modesty, it is the product: the tips are consumables with no entitlement, so a reviewer reading this and a user reading it are told the same thing"
